WEBVTT

00:08.300 --> 00:15.500
Omoi wo ima hanadete hatenai asu ni kazasu yo

00:08.300 --> 00:15.500
I now play my feelings,
out to the endless tomorrow!

00:15.540 --> 00:22.250
Setsunai hodo mune utsu kagirinai kibou

00:15.540 --> 00:22.250
This unbounded hope that beats in my breast
to the point of melancholy

00:23.050 --> 00:30.850
Hakanasa wo masu hibi wo
irodoru wa kisetsu no kaze

00:23.050 --> 00:30.850
The days pass by, becoming more fleeting,
colored by the season's wind

00:30.890 --> 00:35.560
Kioku no kakera ga sawagidashita yo

00:30.890 --> 00:35.560
The fragments of memory started running wild

00:36.160 --> 00:44.560
Arinomama wo mitomete
haruka tsumuida hikari ga

00:36.160 --> 00:44.560
One more time, I want to hold the
spindle of far off light close to my breast,

00:44.610 --> 00:52.240
Kieru mae ni mou ichido
kono mune ni dakishimete

00:44.610 --> 00:52.240
Before it disappears, before
I accept the way things are now

00:54.320 --> 01:01.520
Omoi wo ima hanadete hatenai asu ni kazasu yo

00:54.320 --> 01:01.520
I now play my feelings,
out to the endless tomorrow!

01:01.520 --> 01:08.660
Mirai wo egaku ao ni kono te wo nobashite

01:01.520 --> 01:08.660
Hold out this hand to the blue-painted future

01:08.830 --> 01:15.960
Kasokushiteku sekai yo douka
yasashii mama de ite

01:08.830 --> 01:15.960
The world accelerates, please let it stay this kind

01:16.070 --> 01:23.570
Setsunai hodo mune utsu afuredasu negai

01:16.070 --> 01:23.570
This overflowing wish that beats in my breast
to the point of melancholy

01:36.790 --> 01:38.260
Let's see here...

01:41.230 --> 01:44.360
Sola, Luna, Terra, Aqua, Pyra...

01:46.470 --> 01:49.170
Not bad for an observation diary.

01:50.010 --> 01:51.440
Thank goodness.

01:51.440 --> 01:52.530
But...

01:53.810 --> 01:56.510
Are these your heartfelt feelings?

01:57.650 --> 01:58.980
Why do you ask that?

02:00.550 --> 02:01.310
I'm sorry.

02:02.620 --> 02:05.750
They just seem a little dry...

02:06.720 --> 02:08.280
I'm sorry.

02:09.590 --> 02:11.650
But it was the truth.

02:12.260 --> 02:14.260
Around that time,

02:14.260 --> 02:18.220
I had begun suffering from borrowing
the power of the Djinn.

02:18.600 --> 02:22.230
But I didn't write a single thing about that.

02:24.010 --> 02:28.510
The Flush of Damp Skin

02:49.160 --> 02:50.500
What's the matter?

02:50.500 --> 02:52.970
Oh, it's nothing.

03:10.550 --> 03:13.560
Hey, that's pretty cute.

03:13.560 --> 03:17.010
It's a birthday present I got from Sei and Kai.

03:19.290 --> 03:20.780
Where are you going, Ichika?

03:21.400 --> 03:24.160
To the library to work on my
summer homework.

03:24.830 --> 03:26.060
Would you like to come with me?

03:28.370 --> 03:30.270
Is there some reason to do it?

03:33.210 --> 03:37.710
Did you hear from my mom and dad?

03:37.710 --> 03:38.700
About what?

03:41.820 --> 03:43.410
Never mind.

03:43.790 --> 03:47.520
Lately it's been one strange thing
happening after another.

03:49.360 --> 03:53.230
Manatsu, who appeared from a mirror
in the old school building.

03:53.930 --> 03:59.730
And my family who took her in
without any prior notice.

04:00.640 --> 04:08.410
Even so, I really wanted to treasure this
summer... This year's summer.

04:32.500 --> 04:36.170
Is there some point to doing
summer homework?

04:37.740 --> 04:41.680
Manatsu might have a point.

04:41.680 --> 04:47.580
After all, I'm not going to be
turning it in anywhere.

05:04.900 --> 05:06.030
It's you.

05:10.810 --> 05:13.480
I already read this one.

05:13.480 --> 05:17.580
Um, this is the preschool corner, you know.

05:17.580 --> 05:18.980
I know!

05:23.150 --> 05:27.380
Ichika, I'm totally bored.

05:28.960 --> 05:29.920
Right...

05:42.640 --> 05:44.260
You are a cruel person.

05:50.450 --> 05:51.780
Sei?

05:53.150 --> 05:54.240
What is it?

05:54.650 --> 05:57.620
And he's with my neighbor...

05:59.490 --> 06:00.890
Saya?

06:04.690 --> 06:05.890
But, why?

06:10.700 --> 06:14.440
You and I have no business any longer.

06:14.440 --> 06:15.100
This is a...

06:15.100 --> 06:16.970
...violation of the rules, am I right?

06:17.510 --> 06:19.440
I know that.

06:20.710 --> 06:21.640
Even so...

06:22.240 --> 06:23.300
Six years ago.

06:25.450 --> 06:28.940
Six years ago you gave me your answer.

06:29.720 --> 06:32.710
Or rather, you were not able to answer.

06:34.620 --> 06:35.320
And that is why...

06:35.620 --> 06:36.180
I...

06:40.300 --> 06:43.200
I know that I am to blame.

06:55.110 --> 06:59.310
But, then it should be me that's...

07:01.950 --> 07:03.010
Ichika...

07:04.890 --> 07:05.980
Ichika!

07:24.570 --> 07:25.910
Oh, no!

07:25.910 --> 07:27.500
Ichika, hurry!

07:44.090 --> 07:45.120
Saya?

07:53.130 --> 07:55.900
Any further will be a violation of the rules.

08:04.780 --> 08:06.840
Why... are we running away?

08:08.880 --> 08:12.440
Because... What else could I do?

08:17.790 --> 08:21.230
What else could I have done?

08:23.930 --> 08:27.160
Sei and Saya were...

08:29.100 --> 08:30.400
Ichika?

08:32.410 --> 08:33.240
It's raining.

08:39.450 --> 08:41.620
Even though it was noon,

08:41.620 --> 08:45.050
the darkened sky and chilling rain

08:45.050 --> 08:49.550
bearing down upon my heart were quite enough.

08:50.760 --> 08:53.790
It's raining! Do you hear me,
it's raining, Ichika!

08:54.100 --> 08:56.760
Hurry up over here!

08:58.070 --> 09:00.730
Sheesh, that was awful!

09:01.170 --> 09:02.800
Are you okay, Ichika?

09:02.800 --> 09:04.200
You're soaked.

09:06.370 --> 09:10.000
I wonder if they're also getting rained on?

09:15.180 --> 09:16.380
Ichika.

09:18.250 --> 09:20.380
Why don't you try using that?

10:10.110 --> 10:11.340
Manatsu!

10:11.340 --> 10:13.070
Where are you, Manatsu?

10:13.680 --> 10:15.940
Ichika, are you okay?

10:15.940 --> 10:16.910
Manatsu!

10:17.650 --> 10:19.380
Where are we?

10:19.380 --> 10:20.310
Above the clouds.

10:26.220 --> 10:29.120
The spirit of the sky... The Djinn, Celina.

10:29.890 --> 10:32.090
The Djinn, Celina?

10:33.500 --> 10:37.760
Amazing, huh? It's like we're in
Jack and the Beanstalk!

10:40.170 --> 10:45.200
That's right... The sun hasn't set yet, has it?

11:06.530 --> 11:08.090
It was just a passing shower.

11:08.730 --> 11:09.600
Yes...

11:10.930 --> 11:12.530
You're finally smiling again.

11:17.040 --> 11:19.340
I think I might have gotten a bit chilled.

11:33.050 --> 11:36.550
That is the sixth. The Djinn, Celina.

12:09.720 --> 12:10.920
Good evening.

12:11.290 --> 12:14.750
Welcome, we've been expecting you, Kai.

12:18.330 --> 12:22.070
There are three conditions
for triangles to be congruent...

12:26.870 --> 12:29.000
Ichika, are you listening?

12:31.310 --> 12:32.910
Y-yes!

12:32.910 --> 12:33.640
Are you all right?

12:36.280 --> 12:39.050
Ichika, did you catch a cold?

12:40.190 --> 12:42.050
Do you have a fever?

12:56.240 --> 12:58.670
Sorry, did that upset you?

13:00.210 --> 13:03.370
No, not at all...

13:07.050 --> 13:09.310
You totally have a cold, Ichika.

13:16.420 --> 13:18.490
I'm counting on you, Manatsu.

13:18.490 --> 13:20.860
I'll be back around 3 o'clock.

13:20.860 --> 13:24.770
Don't you worry a thing!
Leave caring for Ichika to me!

13:40.520 --> 13:41.710
Ichika...

13:43.480 --> 13:47.220
Not even crying during a time like this?

13:48.190 --> 13:50.950
I'm such a horrible person.

14:28.800 --> 14:29.990
Manatsu...

14:44.850 --> 14:46.280
I'm covered in sweat...

14:53.490 --> 14:57.230
I should probably hold off taking a shower.

14:57.230 --> 15:00.060
But I feel icky...

15:32.860 --> 15:34.090
Comin'!

15:34.800 --> 15:36.200
I'm comin'...

15:45.240 --> 15:48.170
Oh, hi Sei!

15:48.940 --> 15:51.210
Sei?

15:51.210 --> 15:54.740
Manatsu, I've come to wish Ichika well.

15:55.150 --> 15:57.620
Oh, thank you!

15:57.620 --> 16:01.360
Sei really is quite kind...

16:01.360 --> 16:03.390
So, come on in!

16:03.390 --> 16:04.690
Excuse me.

16:08.260 --> 16:10.750
I bet Ichika'll be really happy to see you.

16:15.440 --> 16:19.270
Ichika, Sei brought you a get-well gift!

16:21.180 --> 16:22.370
Huh?

16:24.950 --> 16:27.140
It looks like she's sound asleep.

16:35.220 --> 16:38.990
I suppose you'll be taking a break
from studying today.

17:07.290 --> 17:10.690
Sei, what were you doing?

17:14.730 --> 17:18.890
What is your relationship with Saya?

17:22.340 --> 17:23.900
Could it be...

17:24.270 --> 17:29.340
Could it be that you... and her...

17:34.350 --> 17:35.510
I can't ask him.

17:36.620 --> 17:40.140
I could never ask him something like that.

17:40.620 --> 17:44.920
Will you tell Ichika I wish her well?

17:45.560 --> 17:46.960
Roger!

17:50.400 --> 17:52.060
Her face is flushed.

17:57.540 --> 18:01.410
His forehead felt so cold...

18:02.840 --> 18:06.370
We were so close our skin was touching,

18:07.750 --> 18:14.250
and yet at that time
I felt very far away from Sei.

18:17.120 --> 18:20.530
It seems she still has a fever.

18:40.150 --> 18:42.480
Oh yes, I also brought these.

18:42.880 --> 18:44.720
What are those?

18:44.720 --> 18:47.150
Give them to Ichika.

19:02.540 --> 19:06.730
I had no idea she was so close.

19:17.590 --> 19:20.050
Ichika's sick?

19:20.350 --> 19:23.360
You let a summer cold get a grip on you
and you're screwed.

19:23.360 --> 19:25.830
Have to make sure you're cured, or else.

19:25.830 --> 19:27.730
Or else what?

19:27.730 --> 19:34.070
Or else our grand project for playing around
all summer will go up in smoke!

19:38.910 --> 19:39.630
Right?

19:40.410 --> 19:41.940
Yes, you're right.

19:41.940 --> 19:46.740
Yes. I wish to pass the time this summer
together with everyone.

19:47.450 --> 19:50.720
Let's all go get something
and pay her a visit!

19:50.720 --> 19:52.210
Roger!

19:53.950 --> 19:56.520
Wait, you were naked the whole time?

19:56.520 --> 19:57.460
Yes...

19:57.460 --> 20:00.830
I'm sorry! I fell asleep...

20:01.800 --> 20:02.990
It's okay.

20:05.200 --> 20:10.070
Oh yeah... Sei told me to give you that as well.

20:10.770 --> 20:13.470
I wonder what it could be?

20:15.580 --> 20:17.870
Hey, can I open it up?

20:28.190 --> 20:31.390
Hey, isn't this...

20:39.200 --> 20:45.000
Sei had noticed that I was there.

20:49.710 --> 20:53.580
Just the thought of it made me...

20:56.550 --> 20:57.180
I was so embarrassed,
I wanted to run away from it all.

20:57.180 --> 20:58.750
I was so embarrassed,
I wanted to run away from it all.
Ichika...

20:58.750 --> 21:02.120
I was so embarrassed,
I wanted to run away from it all.

21:02.960 --> 21:06.290
But it was already too late.

21:07.290 --> 21:15.070
By then it was already too late
for me to escape.

21:47.430 --> 21:50.400


21:51.210 --> 22:00.770
Ano hi deawanakereba ima mo
waraeteta no ka na?

21:51.210 --> 22:00.770
If we hadn't met that day,
would I have still been able to laugh now?

22:02.150 --> 22:13.650
Ano hi nakushita egao itsuka tokeru namida

22:02.150 --> 22:13.650
The smile I lost that day,
the tears that one day melt away...

22:19.170 --> 22:28.940
Hora kotoshi mo ame furu gogo
hakanai utakata no iro

22:19.170 --> 22:28.940
See, this year the afternoon rain falls again
in the color of fleeting bubbles

22:30.010 --> 22:38.850
Sora mo yasashiku mienai wa
datte hitori da mono

22:30.010 --> 22:38.850
The sky doesn't look kind to me, after all,
I'm alone

22:40.490 --> 22:45.490
Itazura na sadame ni kotoba mo denai wa

22:40.490 --> 22:45.490
I have no more words for the tricks of fate

22:45.890 --> 22:53.290
Wakariaeta futari ni mou modorenai no?

22:45.890 --> 22:53.290
Can we never return to two
who understood each other?

22:53.870 --> 23:03.470
Ano hi deawanakereba ima mo
waraeteta no ka na?

22:53.870 --> 23:03.470
If we hadn't met that day,
would I have still been able to laugh now?

23:04.850 --> 23:16.550
Ano hi nakushita egao itsuka tokeru namida

23:04.850 --> 23:16.550
The smile I lost that day,
the tears that one day melt away...

23:20.390 --> 23:21.760


23:21.760 --> 23:24.160
On that day I came to realize

23:24.160 --> 23:26.900
how impossible it was to cope
with a one-sided love,

23:26.900 --> 23:34.310
and how inescapable the urge is
to want that person all to yourself.

23:34.740 --> 23:39.740
On the next Uta~Kata:
The Jealousy of a Twig
